      <h3>Real-World Performance</h3>
      <p>Our client in the DRC ultimately chose the M200. After six months of operation, they're processing an average of 180 tons per hour — well within the M200's capacity. They saved significantly on shipping (2 fewer containers), site preparation, and power infrastructure while still achieving their production goals.</p>
      
      <p>Similar operations in Peru and Ecuador have made different choices based on their specific conditions. The key is matching the equipment to your actual operational needs, not just choosing the biggest available option.</p>
      
